                              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "So the first time I heard that song I was sitting in my dad's truck, and the radio just kind of stopped me cold. I didn't know who it was. I had to wait for the DJ to come back on and say it was Tom Petty, and that was it for me.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.65,
                              "fontFamily": "$font",
                              "fontSize": 17,
